# Abjuration spell names + descriptions.
spell-antimagic_field = Antimagic Field
spell-antimagic_field-desc = Creates a sphere where magic fails: no one inside can cast spells, and magic items go mundane until they leave. Indiscriminate - it suppresses friend, foe, and the caster alike.
spell-freedom_of_movement = Freedom of Movement
spell-freedom_of_movement-desc = A touched ally shrugs off anything that would slow, root, or bind them, moving freely across hindering ground.
spell-lesser_restoration = Lesser Restoration
spell-lesser_restoration-desc = A healing touch purges a poison from a touched ally.
spell-greater_restoration = Greater Restoration
spell-greater_restoration-desc = Channeled restorative energy breaks a lingering curse binding a touched ally.
spell-remove_curse = Remove Curse
spell-remove_curse-desc = A single touch unravels every curse binding a creature.
spell-dispel_magic = Dispel Magic
spell-dispel_magic-desc = Unravels the magical effects afflicting a target at range, snuffing out whatever hostile enchantment holds them.
spell-dispel_evil_and_good = Dispel Evil and Good
spell-dispel_evil_and_good-desc = Radiant warding light wraps around the caster, dulling the blows of otherworldly and undead foes that draw near.
